<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins were steady to $3.00 lower; butts were unevenly steady; skinned hams held steady; seedless bellies ranged steady to $1.00 lower; lean trimmings steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading was reported slow to moderate, with light demand and offerings.</p>
